{"name": "berserk-c81-p02", "created": 1789560326.1347919, "updated": 1789560477.5744069, "params": {"n_predict": 35, "stop": [], "temperature": 2.5, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}, "turn": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "root": "370e80ae", "current": "13ff32aa", "nodes": {"370e80ae": {"id": "370e80ae", "parent": null, "kind": "root", "text": "Municipal Lifts Office\nAcceptance tests following the removal of a floor\n\nBuilding 6, North Court. The fourth floor was removed on 11 March. Its button has been blanked. No alteration to the numbering of the floors above is authorised.\n\nTest 1. Empty car sent from third to fifth. Passed without stopping.\nTest 2. Car loaded with sacks to the weight of one adult. Passed without stopping.\nTest 3. Same load, with a hat placed on the upper sack. Stopped between third and fifth. Doors remained closed for the regulation interval.\n\nThe inspector repeated Test 3 without the hat. This time\n", "ts": 1789560326.13479, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": null}, "35bf101d": {"id": "35bf101d", "parent": "370e80ae", "kind": "model", "text": "the lift did not stop until the fifth floor, and the doors\nwere not kept closed.\n\nA further two tests were attempted. The doors failed\nto close in one;", "ts": 1789560329.4407098, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 35, "tps": 11.8, "params": {"n_predict": 35, "stop": [], "temperature": 1.4, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "36d16320": {"id": "36d16320", "parent": "370e80ae", "kind": "model", "text": "the lift proceeded as in the other two tests.", "ts": 1789560330.402782, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "eos", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 11, "tps": 11.8, "params": {"n_predict": 35, "stop": [], "temperature": 1.7, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}, "berserk": {"note": "the hat. The lift seemed to be saying, “I am a hat. I am the hat that does not stop you at the fourth floor, I am the hat that stops you, I am", "used": "opus"}}}, "021b43c2": {"id": "021b43c2", "parent": "370e80ae", "kind": "model", "text": "the lift stopped before it had risen an inch beyond its starting point. After the interval, it fell back, at a rate that caused a loud bang when it struck its lower", "ts": 1789560333.4161658, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 35, "tps": 11.7, "params": {"n_predict": 35, "stop": [], "temperature": 2.0, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "531c2d36": {"id": "531c2d36", "parent": "370e80ae", "kind": "model", "text": "the lift did not stop but continued to ascend as far as the\nfloor of the top room of Building 6.\n\nHe has certified the lift as ready for public service\n", "ts": 1789560336.415416, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 35, "tps": 11.8, "params": {"n_predict": 35, "stop": [], "temperature": 2.2, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "95112786": {"id": "95112786", "parent": "370e80ae", "kind": "model", "text": "the lift continued to ascend as it had before. The hat is still in place, having become wedged on a spring which would not allow it to move when the bags were", "ts": 1789560339.412908, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 35, "tps": 11.8, "params": {"n_predict": 35, "stop": [], "temperature": 2.4, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "4dd22224": {"id": "4dd22224", "parent": "36d16320", "kind": "model", "text": " The lift\nwas therefore adjudged to have passed.\n\nIn his report he recorded the words “no change”, and added “The operator, when informed, will not be amused", "ts": 1789560358.430316, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 35, "tps": 11.8, "params": {"n_predict": 35, "stop": [], "temperature": 1.4, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, 